<h2>Herdr session</h2>

<p>
  Herdr session <code><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(context.herdr_session.to_s) %></code>
  is running from <code><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(context.sh_workspace.to_s) %></code>.
</p>

<p>Attach from your laptop after the job is ready:</p>

<pre><code>sherlock-herdr <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(session.job_id.to_s) %></code></pre>

<p>One-time setup: run <code>sh_herdr/bin/setup</code> on Sherlock before your first session.</p>

<p>Detach from Herdr when you are finished for now; the session remains available until the Slurm job ends.</p>
